{"id":"20b47403d01d8957","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-fun-constant-function.md","title":"ZFC Fun Constant Function","display":"df-zfc-fun-constant-function — ZFC Fun Constant Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-fun-constant-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-fun-constant-function"],"display":"df-zfc-fun-constant-function — ZFC Fun Constant Function","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-constant]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-fun-constant-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-fun-constant-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-fun-constant-function — ZFC Fun Constant Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e88f14e27e51fd2e\" href=\"?note=e88f14e27e51fd2e\" title=\"58-df-constant\">58-df-constant</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,X,c\\in V\">\\(f,X,c\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConstantValue}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ConstantValue}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (定值常函数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e88f14e27e51fd2e\" href=\"?note=e88f14e27e51fd2e\" title=\"58-df-constant\">58-df-constant</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFunConstantFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFunConstantFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathr